sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 🌍 Public User
    participant CF as ☁️ Cloudflare
    participant KVM41 as 🖥️ KVM4-1<br/>API Gateway
    participant KVM42 as 💾 KVM4-2<br/>Data/Storage
    participant Z890 as 🔧 Z890<br/>Dev/GPU
    participant KVM2 as 🌐 KVM2<br/>Exit Proxy

    Note over CF: DNS: *.pmoves.ai

    User->>CF: HTTPS api.pmoves.ai
    CF->>KVM41: Proxy (Cloudflare Tunnel)
    KVM41->>Z890: Reverse proxy to service
    Z890-->>KVM41: Response
    KVM41-->>CF: Response
    CF-->>User: Response

    Note over KVM41,KVM42: Internal data flow

    KVM41->>KVM42: Query Supabase/Neo4j/Qdrant
    KVM42-->>KVM41: Data response

    Note over Z890,KVM2: Tailscale mesh

    Z890->>KVM2: Outbound via exit node
    KVM2-->>Z890: Return traffic

    Note over User,KVM2: NATS pub/sub (port 4222)

    Z890->>KVM41: NATS publish event
    KVM41->>KVM42: NATS forward to workers
    KVM42-->>Z890: NATS response
